  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the River of Time it looks like an island. Observers name it a stone lotus island, and also call it a mysterious stone island.",
      "chapters": [
        1406
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From Mo Yao’s will, Fang Yuan learns that Red Lotus Demon Venerable’s inheritance sits in the River of Time. The first condition is to have Spring Autumn Cicada. The Gu Immortal must self-detonate and use Spring Autumn Cicada to carry their will into the river, then search for a stone lotus island; only after reaching one do they see Red Lotus’ will left there. Fang Yuan has entered the River of Time three times before and found none, and he cannot yet steer Spring Autumn Cicada to hunt for one.",
      "chapters": [
        830
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_yao",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Central Continent region field because chapter 830 first names the islands while Fang Yuan is based at Hu Immortal blessed land. The novel seats them in the River of Time, not as a five-region map pin.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Red Lotus arranged all seven of his true inheritances on stone lotus islands at different areas of the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [
        1435
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seven-true-inheritances",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Red Lotus could create artificial secluded domains of heaven and earth as stone lotus islands to influence segments of the River of Time and take control of it. Heavenly Court designs a time path formation meant to encapsulate those islands and weaken them as artificial time path secluded domains.",
      "chapters": [
        1631
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "artificial-secluded-domains",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long recalls Red Lotus telling him that many stone lotus islands in the River of Time are not connected to each other, yet share a special influence, and that all of them form one immortal killer move, Red Lotus’ proudest creation, able to influence the river’s flow and indirectly affect the traces of all beings.",
      "chapters": [
        1789
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-killer-move",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the River of Time, a stone lotus island appears before Feng Jiu Ge, and he enters it after linking it to Qin Ding Ling’s luck reading that his fortuitous encounter is there.",
      "chapters": [
        1938
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ge-on-an-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the island Feng Jiu Ge browses memories left by Red Lotus, and Red Lotus’ will gives him the rank eight future self killer move and an incomplete destiny Gu Immortal Gu recipe suited to the destiny song he will create. Fang Yuan had guided him to that island so he could gain the true inheritance. Feng Jiu Ge leaves with a heavy heart after refusing to destroy fate Gu or resist Heavenly Court solely for that gift.",
      "chapters": [
        1965
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gift-on-the-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan states that Red Lotus built the stone lotus islands in the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [
        1993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "builder-of-the-islands",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
